36739>>>>>>>        Get CNG_PBKDF2_HMAC_BufferSizeEx hoProv to uiHashLen
36740>>>>>>>        
36740>>>>>>>        Move (CNG_BCryptCloseAlgorithmProvider(hoProv, 0)) to iErr
36741>>>>>>>        
36741>>>>>>>        Function_Return uiHashLen
36742>>>>>>>    End_Function
