37251>>>>>    
37251>>>>>    //
37251>>>>>    // This procedure is called when validating a session and after logging in. Its purpose is to 
37251>>>>>    // update properties based on the session and user data. Augment this function to update 
37251>>>>>    // properties based on the session / user table. Note that WebAppUser and WebAppSession contain
37251>>>>>    // the right records when this procedure is called.
37251>>>>>    //
37251>>>>>    // Params:
37251>>>>>    //      bClear   True if the procedure is called before session validation to clear properties.
37251>>>>>    //
37251>>>>>    Procedure UpdateSessionProperties Boolean bClear
37253>>>>>        Handle hoUserDD
37253>>>>>        
37253>>>>>        Get phoUserDD to hoUserDD
37254>>>>>        
37254>>>>>        //  Update user properties
37254>>>>>        If (not(bClear) and HasRecord(hoUserDD)) Begin
37256>>>>>            Set psUsername to (Trim(WebAppUser.FullName))
37257>>>>>            Set psLoginName to (Trim(WebAppUser.LoginName))
37258>>>>>            Set piUserRights to WebAppUser.Rights
37259>>>>>            
37259>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesSet 
37260>>>>>        End
37260>>>>>>
37260>>>>>        Else Begin
37261>>>>>            Set psUsername to ""
37262>>>>>            Set psLoginName to ""
37263>>>>>            Set piUserRights to 0
37264>>>>>            
37264>>>>>            Send OnSessionPropertiesClear
37265>>>>>        End
37265>>>>>>
37265>>>>>    End_Procedure
37266>>>>>    
37266>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesSet
37268>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37268>>>>>    End_Procedure
37269>>>>>    
37269>>>>>    Procedure OnSessionPropertiesClear
37271>>>>>        //  Empty event stub
37271>>>>>    End_Procedure
