37274>>>>>        
37274>>>>>        Get phoSessionDD to hoSessionDD
37275>>>>>        Get pbLogWebSession to bLogWebSession
37276>>>>>        If not bLogWebSession Begin
37278>>>>>            Forward Send EndSession
37280>>>>>            Procedure_Return
37281>>>>>        End
37281>>>>>>
37281>>>>>            
37281>>>>>        //  Check if session exists
37281>>>>>        Send Clear of hoSessionDD
37282>>>>>        Get psSessionKey to WebAppSession.SessionKey
37283>>>>>        
37283>>>>>        Send Find of hoSessionDD EQ Index.1
37284>>>>>        If (Found) Begin
37286>>>>>            Set Field_Changed_Value of hoSessionDD Field WebAppSession.Active to "N"
37287>>>>>            Get Request_Validate of hoSessionDD to iErr
37288>>>>>            If (iErr) Begin
37290>>>>>                // this should not happen. If it does its a programming error
37290>>>>>                Error DFERR_PROGRAM C_$WebAppSessionValidateFailed
37291>>>>>>
37291>>>>>                Procedure_Return
37292>>>>>            End
37292>>>>>>
37292>>>>>            Send Request_Save of hoSessionDD
37293>>>>>        End
37293>>>>>>
37293>>>>>    End_Procedure
