38315>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoJson
38316>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
38317>>>>>>>>>    
38317>>>>>>>>>    Function HttpDeleteJson String sHost String sFilePath Handle hoJsonRequest Boolean ByRef bOk Returns Handle
38319>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoJson
