38320>>>>>>>>>        Function_Return hoJson
38321>>>>>>>>>    End_Function
38322>>>>>>>>>    
38322>>>>>>>>>    Function HttpPatchJson  String sHost String sFilePath Handle hoJsonRequest Boolean ByRef bOk Returns Handle
38324>>>>>>>>>        Handle hoJson
